{"id":"daa79d764aa382e2","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-graph-edge-set.md","title":"ZFC Graph Edge Set","display":"df-zfc-graph-edge-set — ZFC Graph Edge Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-graph-edge-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-graph-edge-set"],"display":"df-zfc-graph-edge-set — ZFC Graph Edge Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-graph-edge-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-graph-edge-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-graph-edge-set — ZFC Graph Edge Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,G,X\\in V\">\\(E,G,X\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Graph}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Graph}_S\\)</span> (simple-graph predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphEdgeSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGraphEdgeSet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}edge\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGraphEdgeSet}_S(E,G,X)\\leftrightarrow G=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}edge\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGraphEdgeSet}_S(E,G,X)\\leftrightarrow G=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The edge-set projection now reuses the canonical simple-graph predicate and avoids using <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> simultaneously for a vertex set and the set-theoretic universe.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Graph}_S$ (simple-graph predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E,G,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Graph}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphEdgeSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}edge\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGraphEdgeSet}_S(E,G,X)\\leftrightarrow G=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":825,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2242","locations":["正文"],"count":1